    "bio": "a Delegate from the Northern Mariana Islands; born in Saipan, Northern Mariana Islands, January 19, 1955; graduated from Marianas High School, Susupe, Northern Mariana Islands, 1972; attended University of Hawaii, Manoa, Hawaii, 1989-1990; United States Army, 1981-1986; member of the Northern Mariana Islands house of representatives, 1982-1986; staff, United States Senator Daniel Inouye of Hawaii; staff, office of the Governor of the Northern Mariana Islands; elected as an Independent to the One Hundred Eleventh Congress, changed his party affiliation from an Independent to a Democrat on February 23, 2009, elected as a Democrat to the One Hundred Twelfth and to the six succeeding Congresses (January 3, 2009-January 3, 2025); was not a candidate for reelection to the One Hundred Nineteenth Congress in 2024.",
